    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9cef863845f2993",
      "translationZh": "MobileMoE 是一个端侧混合专家（MoE）语言模型系列，激活参数量低于十亿，旨在推动端侧 LLM 的质量–效率帕累托前沿，包含三种模型规模（S/M/L）：激活参数量为 0.3B/0.5B/0.9B（总参数量为 1.3B/2.8B/5.3B），INT4 权重占用空间 <3 GB，可容纳于移动设备的 DRAM 中。每种规模均发布三个变体：Base 模型（预训练 + 中期训练）、SFT 模型（监督微调）和 QAT 模型（量化感知训练）。你当前所在的是 MobileMoE-L-Base 仓库——激活参数量为 0.9B 的预训练基础模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88c9f376d9508010",
      "translationZh": "模型：MobileMoE-L-Base（经过预训练 + 中期训练）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c95c8f3d369b189",
      "translationZh": "路由专家：60 个（细粒度，每个专家的 FFN 隐藏维度为 640）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a9ba3da48469dcb",
      "translationZh": "每个 token 的激活专家数：4（采用 top-k sigmoid 路由，并进行归一化）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7da79ff2194bdb8c",
      "translationZh": "共享专家：1 个，始终激活（FFN 隐藏维度为 2560）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7d6280e8da21cf2",
      "translationZh": "词表大小：128,256",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56993468cdeda525",
      "translationZh": "其他特性：QK-Norm、输入/输出嵌入权重共享、RoPE（θ = 500,000）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31a04b73e0db7959",
      "translationZh": "训练阶段：预训练 → 中期训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a38da916f613a07",
